This product includes software and prompt text adapted from third parties,
with modifications:

1. The review prompts and the hook design are adapted from the
   `security-guidance` plugin in https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official
   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
   Copyright Anthropic, PBC.
   - prompts/investigate.md is adapted from AGENTIC_INVESTIGATE_SYSTEM and
     build_investigate_prompt() in plugins/security-guidance/hooks/review_api.py;
   - prompts/refute.md is adapted from AGENTIC_REFUTE_SYSTEM and
     build_refute_prompt() in the same file;
   - format_findings() in hooks/commit_sentry.py is adapted from
     format_findings() and filter_by_severity() in the same file.
   Changes: the text was shortened and reworded, merged into single prompts
   for `claude -p` (diff embedded in the prompt, read-only tools), given a
   different JSON output format (a fenced block with file/line/severity/...
   fields, and per-candidate verdicts with severity), extended with
   project-context, untrusted-data and agent-configuration guidance, and the
   severity scale was changed to HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW.

2. The prompt approach (separate finding and false-positive filtering stages)
   is adapted from https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code-security-review
   Licensed under the MIT License. Copyright Anthropic, PBC.
   The confidence thresholds, severity definitions, exclusions and precedents
   in prompts/investigate.md and prompts/refute.md are adapted, shortened and
   modified from the audit prompt in claudecode/prompts.py and the
   false-positive filtering instructions in claudecode/claude_api_client.py.

